<span class="tinyicontxt">Icecrown Citadel</span></a> and <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4603/vault-of-archavon">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Vault of Archavon</span></a>, the weekly raid quest and weekly ICC raid quest, as well as the daily titan rune gamma dungeons for over a hundred possible emblems per week. <br/>
<br/>For Tier 10 you will actually have to purchase the ilvl 251 pieces using your emblems and then upgrade them with the <span class="q4">Conqueror's Marks</span> that drop within <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4812/icecrown-citadel">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Icecrown Citadel</span></a>. Every class in the game will be after the emblems, so just tag along with your guildies and try to farm as many of these as you can.<br/>
<br/>Considering <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4603/vault-of-archavon">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Vault of Archavon</span></a> can drop the T10 gloves and legs, you should also use up your weekly lockout before spending emblems on these pieces.<br/>
<br/>As you will want to get four tier items before swapping this set on, the specific order you buy them in doesn't really matter.<br/>
