<br/>As caster dps are likely to opt for their crit/<wbr/>haste tier chest or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50629/robe-of-the-waking-nightmare">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_77.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Robe of the Waking Nightmare</span></a>, it shouldn't be too tricky to grab <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50717/sanguine-silk-robes">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_80.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sanguine Silk Robes</span></a> as your offpiece  for the massive amount of haste and regeneration it provides.<br/>
<br/>Until then you could choose between the lower ilvl 10-man version <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51851/bloodsoul-raiment">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_80.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bloodsoul Raiment</span></a> or the emblem option <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50974/meteor-chasers-raiment">
