<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="hands">Hands for Holy Priest Healer Phase 4</h3>Besides the shoulders, this is the tier slot that gains the least value from the ilvl increases, so use your <span class="q4">Conqueror's Marks</span> on your other pieces first.<br/>
<br/>Although these have ~2.5% lower haste, the 18 spell power, 2.25% crit and additional primary stats you gain by using <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50722/sanlayn-ritualist-gloves">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_92.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">San'layn Ritualist Gloves</span></a> over <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51851/bloodsoul-raiment">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_80.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bloodsoul Raiment</span></a> makes this one of the better alternatives to the 277 chest offpiece. <br/>
<br/>Just keep in mind that you will need to clear one of the harder <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4812/icecrown-citadel">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Icecrown Citadel</span></a> encounters for them.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Glove Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=54999/hyperspeed-accelerators">
