<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="jewelry">Jewelry for Holy Priest Healer Phase 4</h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="neck">Neck for Holy Priest Healer Phase 4</h3>While you could make good use of both ilvl 277 choices, obtaining <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50609/bone-sentinels-amulet">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_53.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bone Sentinel's Amulet</span></a> will be much easier, considering the high demand for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50724/blood-queens-crimson-choker">
