<br/>If you did not get the <span class="q4">Val'kyr</span> neck in the previous phase, you could pick up one of the 10-man options as a placeholder in the meantime.<br/>
<br/>While the personal stat gain from <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=24116/eye-of-the-night">
