<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="rings">Rings for Holy Priest Healer Phase 4</h3>This time around, there are actually a few new options worth considering when it comes to rings.<br/>
<br/>An easy pick for your first slot is the free ring rewarded by <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/faction=1156/the-ashen-verdict">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The Ashen Verdict</span></a>, which levels up depending on your reputation with this faction. As long as you don't mind the occasional "A more powerful spell is already active" error when trying to refresh a Renew, it's a solid ring once you reach Revered or even Exalted.<br/>
