<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="trinkets">Trinkets for Holy Priest Healer Phase 4</h3>Considering <span class="q4">Solace</span> not only has quite high spellpower but also provides as much consistent Mp5 as certain regeneration trinkets, it's a great choice to just keep permanently equipped once you have it. Just keep in mind that the heroic and normal version of it cannot be used together in WotLK Classic.<br/>
<br/>As for your other slot, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50366/althors-abacus">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_trinket_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Althor's Abacus</span></a> grants you a large amount of spell power alongside a neat proc that is basically a free smart heal <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=48071/flash-heal">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_flashheal.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Flash Heal</span></a> added onto your cast once every 45 seconds that can even crit. While all healers besides your <span class="c2">Holy Paladin(s)</span> will want it, it's definitely a great pick.<br/>
<br/>If you do want some additional regeneration, you could also swap in one of the three mixed <span class="q4">sp/<wbr/>mp5 trinkets</span> or even go for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46051/meteorite-crystal">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/achievement_dungeon_ulduarraid_misc_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Meteorite Crystal</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
