<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="weapons">Weapons and Offhands for Holy Priest Healer Phase 4</h2>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="main-and-two-handed-weapons-for-holy-priest-healer-phase-4">Main and Two-Handed Weapons for Holy Priest Healer Phase 4</h4>Assuming you have obtained <a class="q5 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46017/valanyr-hammer-of-ancient-kings">
