<br/>That said, with our HoTs and multi-target heals granting us many chances to trigger <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50685/trauma">
