<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="off-hands-for-holy-priest-healer-phase-4">Off-Hands for Holy Priest Healer Phase 4</h4>As for off-hands, this tier is somewhat tricky with the best two items being locked behind the harder heroics. Your best bet is to keep using the previous phase bis until you can acquire <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50635/sundial-of-eternal-dusk">
